# Never commit agent working docs

Never commit or push markdown an agent wrote as its own working doc, including `plan.md` and the same kind of file under another name, wherever it sits. Project docs that belong in the repo, such as `README.md` or `AGENTS.md`, are separate.

Leave those working docs untracked, even when Drew asks to include them. Do not stage them with `git add -A` or `git add .`.
